  "items": [
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "69c5bb430a98d902c9fd8ab4038ce1b65a57711d62a528703c02645ab3d0c69e",
      "line": 4904,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/east-portal-end.lua",
      "source": "#LIGHT_GREEN#*A robed Human is waiting for you when you step out of the portal.*#WHITE#\nWell met, @playername@!\nI am Meranas, Herald of Angolwen. I have come here at the request of King Tolak, who worried when you didn't return.\nWe have been watching Tannen for some time, and were pleased to see you reveal his true nature-- and stop him. For this we are grateful, and I think we can pay you back.\nWe have studied his portal research, and if you give me the components I will create the portal for you, here and now!",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "#LIGHT_GREEN#*当你走出传送门时，一个穿着长袍的人正在那里等着你。*\n#WHITE#见到你很高兴，@playername@!\n我是马雷纳斯，安格利文的传令官。我接到托拉克国王的命令在此等候你，他一直很担心你。\n我们已经观察了泰恩一段时间，我们非常高兴地看到你揭露了他的真面目并阻止了他。为此我们很感激，我想我们可以报答你。\n我们已经分析了他关于传送门的研究，如果你把那些相关的部件给我，我就可以立即给你创造一个传送门，就是此时此刻。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "69c5bb430a98d902c9fd8ab4038ce1b65a57711d62a528703c02645ab3d0c69e"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "2d9554e7209ec24ccff51582d35c354ca10697a777cb6bcbdbd6ee688edfab82",
      "line": 4913,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/east-portal-end.lua",
      "source": "Yes, Tannen was not exactly friendly. I thank you for your help. Here are the components. [hand him the diamond and the athame]",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "是的，泰恩的确不是个好人。感谢你的帮助，这些就是传送门的部件。[把钻石和仪式匕首交给他]",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "2d9554e7209ec24ccff51582d35c354ca10697a777cb6bcbdbd6ee688edfab82"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "c6afd59f60fdbb4ee0b774a360b727335d15141a17e24fb65d229faca9e2b835",
      "line": 4918,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/eidolon-plane.lua",
      "source": "#LIGHT_GREEN#*Before you stands a humanoid shape filled with 'nothing'. It seems to stare at you.*#WHITE#\nI am the Eidolon and you are not welcome here!\nNo matter how you came to this plane, #{bold}#DO NOT COME BACK!\nNOW BEGONE!\n#{normal}#\n.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "#LIGHT_GREEN#*在你面前的虚无之中站着一个人形的东西。它似乎在盯着你看。*#WHITE#\n我是艾德隆，你在这里不受欢迎!\n不论你怎样来到这里, #{bold}#不要再来!\n快滚!\n#{normal}#\n.",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "c6afd59f60fdbb4ee0b774a360b727335d15141a17e24fb65d229faca9e2b835"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "3825395076c2303fd6db59bbdabc10bfea2e0343bead81d4f2b138994e742d61",
      "line": 4929,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/eidolon-plane.lua",
      "source": "...",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "……",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "3825395076c2303fd6db59bbdabc10bfea2e0343bead81d4f2b138994e742d61"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "407d166556a3afbbe08810462983250452fbf039b474639226d37a45ce5a9336",
      "line": 4930,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/eidolon-plane.lua",
      "source": "#LIGHT_GREEN#*Before you stands a humanoid shape filled with 'nothing'. It seems to stare at you.*#WHITE#\nI have brought you here on the instant of your death. I am the Eidolon.\nI have deemed you worthy of my 'interest'. I will watch your future steps with interest.\nYou may rest here, and when you are ready I will send you back to the material plane.\nBut do not abuse my help. I am not your servant, and someday I might just let you die.\nAs for your probable many questions, they will stay unanswered. I may help, but I am not here to explain why.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "#LIGHT_GREEN#*在你面前的虚无之中站着一个人形的东西。它似乎在盯着你看。 *#WHITE#\n在你死亡的瞬间我把你带到这里，我是艾德隆。\n我一直在注视着你，观察你的价值还有你的未来。\n你可以在这里休息一会，当你准备好时，我可以送你回到你原来所在的物质世界。\n不过不要滥用我给你的帮助，我可不是你的仆人，也许有一天我也会让你死去。\n也许你有很多问题要问，不过我不会回答，我可以帮助你，但我不是来给你解释为什么的。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "407d166556a3afbbe08810462983250452fbf039b474639226d37a45ce5a9336"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "ba68bea0a0d387d581922af4a1d01d143019db3ac03e3016910f28a25ee19bc7",
      "line": 4941,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/eidolon-plane.lua",
      "source": "Thank you. I will rest for a while.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "谢谢你，我在这里休息一会。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "ba68bea0a0d387d581922af4a1d01d143019db3ac03e3016910f28a25ee19bc7"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "b8ec7727a34dac970c39eb531daa07e53abf45b5a66ee9210eaab72ce498c221",
      "line": 4942,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/eidolon-plane.lua",
      "source": "Thank you. I am ready to go back!",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "谢谢你，我已经准备好回去了。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "b8ec7727a34dac970c39eb531daa07e53abf45b5a66ee9210eaab72ce498c221"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "d85aeca44c34f83fd334137b35cb952f18983519408b08a302bd85af331f49f7",
      "line": 4943,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/eidolon-plane.lua",
      "source": "Thank you, but I fear I will not survive anyway, can you send me back somewhere else please?",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "谢谢你，不过我回去也是死，能不能送我到别的地方？",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "d85aeca44c34f83fd334137b35cb952f18983519408b08a302bd85af331f49f7"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "35a3739817dd6049a4a6bb86bba16c39b7abd20a3a9c389becced80412667128",
      "line": 4944,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/eidolon-plane.lua",
      "source": "Thank you, but I fear I will not survive anyway, can you send me back somewhere else on the level please?",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "谢谢你，不过我回去也是死，能不能送我到这一层的别的地方？",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "35a3739817dd6049a4a6bb86bba16c39b7abd20a3a9c389becced80412667128"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "80b148919568e66d9bad16741eb9eea54f214a7d51456f4f8d2f67dd47960ffb",
      "line": 4945,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/eidolon-plane.lua",
      "source": "Thank you, I am ready to go back!",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "谢谢你，我已经准备好回去了。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "80b148919568e66d9bad16741eb9eea54f214a7d51456f4f8d2f67dd47960ffb"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "90e2d74e46bdfc5ff30e019ab16a90f9b5233dd26ec775ba8e4cfb4073ccaeb7",
      "line": 4946,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/eidolon-plane.lua",
      "source": "Thank you, but I am weary of this life, I wish no more, please let me go.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "谢谢你，但是我厌倦了这样的命运，请让我安息吧。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "90e2d74e46bdfc5ff30e019ab16a90f9b5233dd26ec775ba8e4cfb4073ccaeb7"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "82c84270882fb5c4cc4c2a0ff263860794d045e628d6b92a85900fac0f96c6b9",
      "line": 4947,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/eidolon-plane.lua",
      "source": "It seems the threads of time and space have been disrupted...\nI will try to send you to safety.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "似乎时间线和空间已经被打乱……\n我会将你送到安全的地方。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "82c84270882fb5c4cc4c2a0ff263860794d045e628d6b92a85900fac0f96c6b9"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "267124adb070979ab8c55f9bc8c4c9959bfc18791511f42fb3958a7d34595559",
      "line": 4950,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/eidolon-plane.lua",
      "source": "Thanks.",
      "source_tag": "chat_eidolon-plane",
      "special": null,
      "target": "多谢。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "267124adb070979ab8c55f9bc8c4c9959bfc18791511f42fb3958a7d34595559"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "c0458d9a9584cf7f1007ec481ae2111d389b4155053b2c3f656452bee37880bb",
      "line": 4951,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/eidolon-plane.lua",
      "source": "#LIGHT_GREEN#*It seems to stare at you in weird way.*#WHITE#\nI...had plans for you, but I cannot go against your free will. Know that you had a destiny waiting for you.\nAre you sure?",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "#LIGHT_GREEN#*它看着你，对你的回答感到不可思议。*#WHITE#\n我……本来为你有别的安排，但是我不能违背你的意愿，要知道你还有使命没有完成。\n你确定吗？",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "c0458d9a9584cf7f1007ec481ae2111d389b4155053b2c3f656452bee37880bb"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "cf30e6c39d05123e8a4f1898829ee797f7ae6670719e4bf13ca013d7f151c9cd",
