      "entry_id": "410ec055275e4a73cea6b79acaec9b58dbe656a5e76bd9319532bcc5f2cd7204",
      "line": 4990,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/elisa-shop.lua",
      "source": "Thank you, Elisa!",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "谢谢你，埃莉萨！",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "410ec055275e4a73cea6b79acaec9b58dbe656a5e76bd9319532bcc5f2cd7204"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "25e15c460b5f60a156681211563f4f85db157043a1161893b287b858e12dbadb",
      "line": 4991,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/elisa-shop.lua",
      "source": "Hello friend, what can I do for you?",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "你好朋友，我能帮你什么忙么？",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "25e15c460b5f60a156681211563f4f85db157043a1161893b287b858e12dbadb"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "fe6b9855e619f155d46c9810025359ece0ed5fd1c91f2c4a10944c5d6dfccfb5",
      "line": 4992,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/elisa-shop.lua",
      "source": "Could you have a look at these objects, please? [show her your unidentified items]",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "你能帮我看看这些物品么？[将未辨识的物品给她看。]",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "fe6b9855e619f155d46c9810025359ece0ed5fd1c91f2c4a10944c5d6dfccfb5"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "a6ee7c548a8033eb3dad5ab0bb2fe7dd764a2ed4014d22b29742b3a92c087c47",
      "line": 4993,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/elisa-shop.lua",
      "source": "Nothing, goodbye.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "没事，再见。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "a6ee7c548a8033eb3dad5ab0bb2fe7dd764a2ed4014d22b29742b3a92c087c47"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "47f0295df10cfb707e2077f2d2feed12cd4e19c33d8525baeac16a95be340ffc",
      "line": 4994,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/elisa-shop.lua",
      "source": "Wait, @playername@, you seem to be quite the adventurer. Maybe we can help one another.\nYou see, I #{bold}#LOOOVVVEEEE#{normal}# learning new lore and finding old artifacts of power, but I am not exactly an adventurer and I would surely get killed out there.\nSo take this orb (#LIGHT_GREEN#*she gives you an orb of scrying*#WHITE#). You can use it to talk to me from anywhere in the world! This way you can show me your new shiny findings!\nI get to see many interesting things, and you get to know what your items do. We both win! Isn't it sweet?\nOh yes, the orb will also identify mundane items for you, as long as you carry it.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "等等，@playername@，你看上去像一个冒险家。也许我们能互相帮助。\n你看，我#{bold}#热爱#{normal}#学习新的手稿和搜集拥有古老力量的物品。不过我自己并不是一个真正的冒险家，而且我如果出去冒险的话肯定会被杀掉。\n所以拿着这个水晶球吧，(#LIGHT_GREEN#*她给了你一个辨识水晶*#WHITE#)。你可以在世界的任何一个角落用这个水晶球和我联络。要是你发现什么闪闪发光的好东西，你就可以随时随地给我看了！\n我可以看到有趣的东西，而你又能知道你所获得的是什么装备，一举两得！听上去应该不错吧？\n而且，你只要携带着它，它也会帮你辨认普通物品。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "47f0295df10cfb707e2077f2d2feed12cd4e19c33d8525baeac16a95be340ffc"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "c106a379956e387975d146befc0723522ae89be8bfb3a93550ecd782d341063b",
      "line": 5003,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/elisa-shop.lua",
      "source": "Woah, thanks, Elisa. This is really nice!",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "哇～太好了，埃莉萨，这可太棒了！",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
